# Yule — a kid by Chesburg's well who lost their ball down it. Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@speaker Yule
@when yule_got_ball -> after
@when yule_quest_accepted -> reminder

== offer ==
Psst! ...You're the one who's going down the well, right? Everyone's talking about it.
I kicked my ball in there yesterday. It was [i]so[/i] bouncy. Mama says never go near the well. [whisper]So, uh... will you?[/whisper]
> I'll look for it. -> accepted [set yule_quest_accepted]
> Sorry, I'm busy. -> busy

== busy ==
[sad]Oh... okay.[/sad] It's right by where you land, I think. If you [i]happen[/i] to see it...

== accepted ==
Really?! [bounce]Yay![/bounce] It's red with a yellow stripe. Don't tell Mama!

== reminder ==
Did you find my ball? It's red with a yellow stripe.
> Here it is! -> thanks [item yule_ball] [set yule_got_ball]
> Still looking.

== thanks ==
[bounce]My BALL![/bounce] You found it! Thank you, thank you! Here, take this. I was saving it, but you earned it.

== after ==
Mama still doesn't know. [whisper]Thanks again.[/whisper]
